Package: genesys-common
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates, gpgv, zstd
Description: GenESyS stable launcher and runtime dispatcher
 GenESyS is a C++ simulation platform designed as an extensible
 architecture for modeling and simulation.
 .
 This package provides the stable launcher, non-interactive dispatcher,
 administrative update policy and shared public entry points used to select
 either a per-user runtime or the Debian-provided system fallback.

Package: genesys-shell
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, genesys-common (= ${binary:Version})
Description: GenESyS command-line shell
 GenESyS is a C++ simulation platform designed as an extensible
 architecture for modeling and simulation.
 .
 This package provides the command-line shell system fallback and its public
 dispatcher entry point.

Package: genesys-worker
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, genesys-common (= ${binary:Version})
Breaks: genesys-web (<< ${binary:Version})
Replaces: genesys-web (<< ${binary:Version})
Description: GenESyS HTTP worker runtime
 GenESyS is a C++ simulation platform designed as an extensible
 architecture for modeling and simulation.
 .
 This package provides the canonical genesys-worker system fallback, the
 public dispatcher entry point and the legacy genesys-web command alias.
 The worker is not intended for direct public-Internet exposure.

Package: genesys-gui
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, genesys-common (= ${binary:Version}), genesys-shell (= ${binary:Version}), genesys-worker (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Generic and Expansible System Simulator Qt GUI
 GenESyS is a C++ simulation platform designed as an extensible
 architecture for modeling and simulation.
 .
 This package provides the Qt desktop graphical user interface, desktop
 integration and a complete GUI/Shell/Worker system fallback installation.

Package: genesys-web
Section: oldlibs
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, genesys-worker (= ${binary:Version})
Description: transitional package for the GenESyS worker
 This transitional package preserves upgrades from the historical genesys-web
 Debian package. The canonical package and executable are now genesys-worker;
 the public genesys-web command remains available as a compatibility alias.
